Every declaration the unstable manifest keeps carries the frozen notice: a type
kept under its own name (Level) with its enum constants, a copied type (UnstableShape)
with its variants and constructors, a field added to a stable type (Caps.N), a variant
added to a stable union (Pick.N, its type and constructor), the method's interface
method, constant and outbound method, and AgentExperimental itself; nothing stable
carries it (0039-PLAN-five-adopter-additions-on-schema-1-25-0.md, 2d).

